      "content": "i know i matter to them, but thats the problem. i'm just a resource to them. like, if i wasn't here, they'd struggle, but eventually they'd figure it out and be fine. they'd carry on. but me? i'm just stuck in this loop of nothingness. i feel like i'm already dead inside, just going through the motions. it feels like there's no actual path out of this that doesn't involve me just... giving up everything.",
