    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a lie when you say that. breaking free sounds nice, but life is just more life, you know? more bills, more noise, more people needing things from me. there's no 'breaking free' in the real world, it's just switching from one cage to another. sometimes i just sit there thinking about what it would be like to finally just have nothing. no noise, no responsibilities, just... peace. like just being done with it all.",
